    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "that's a pretty intense way to put it—\"a direct attack.\" but i've also heard environmental groups saying these mandates are the only way to stop irreversible damage to the local air quality. is there actually any merit to their argument, or is the \"environmental protection\" side just a cover for something else?",
